{"sections":[{"slug":"全纯向量丛","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"全纯向量丛"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">全纯向量丛</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“全纯向量丛”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>$n$ <span lang=\"zh\">维</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">全纯向量丛</span></strong> (holomorphic vector bundle) <span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/复流形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">复流形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">上以</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">全纯映射</span></strong> $U_{ij}\\to GL(n,\\mathbb{C})$ <span lang=\"zh\">为转移函数的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/复向量丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">复向量丛</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">全纯向量丛也可等价地定义为投影映射</span> $E\\to X$ <span lang=\"zh\">是复流形全纯映射的复向量丛</span>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">注</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">复向量丛可在一般的空间上定义</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">而全纯向量丛依赖于底流形的复结构</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即全纯向量丛只能在</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">复流形</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">上定义</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">度数</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/全纯线丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">全纯线丛</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的度数是除子的</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">系数之和</span>”, <span lang=\"zh\">与第一</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/陈类","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">陈类</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">有关</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">全纯向量丛</span> $E$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">度数</span></strong> (degree) <span lang=\"zh\">定义为其行列式丛</span> $\\wedge^r E$ <span lang=\"zh\">的度数</span>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">对两个全纯向量丛</span> $E_1,E_2$,\n$$\r\n\\deg (E_1\\otimes E_2) = \\deg(E_1)\\operatorname{rank}(E_2) + \\operatorname{rank}(E_1)\\deg(E_2).\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">全纯截面</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">全纯向量丛</span> $E$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">全纯截面</span></strong> (holomorphic section) <span lang=\"zh\">是指局部</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">在某个平凡化中</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">全纯的截面</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">全纯截面构成一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">层</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal O(E)$. <span lang=\"zh\">有时人们不区分全纯向量丛与其对应的层</span>.</p>\n<h2>$\\bar\\partial$ <span lang=\"zh\">算子</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">全纯向量丛上的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">光滑截面</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">上可定义算子</span>\n$$\\bar\\partial_E \\colon\r\nC^\\infty(M,E)\\to C^\\infty(M,E\\otimes {T^*}''M).\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">具体地</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">给定局部的全纯截面</span> $\\sigma_i$, <span lang=\"zh\">对光滑截面</span> $s= f^i \\sigma_i$ <span lang=\"zh\">有</span> $\\bar\\partial_E s = (\\bar\\partial f^i) \\sigma_i.$ <span lang=\"zh\">由于转移函数是全纯的</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">这个表达式不依赖于</span> $\\sigma_i$ <span lang=\"zh\">的选取</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">例如复流形上的微分形式有算子</span>\n$$\r\n\\bar\\partial \\colon C^\\infty (\\wedge^{p,q}M)\\to C^\\infty(\\wedge^{p,q+1}M).\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">等价定义</span></h2>\n<p>(<span lang=\"zh\">待补充</span>)</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">联络</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/陈联络","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">陈联络</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">分类</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定理</span></strong> <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $\\mathbb P^1$ <span lang=\"zh\">或</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/椭圆曲线","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">椭圆曲线</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">则</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的全纯向量丛等同于代数向量丛</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">也即局部自由层</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">参见</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/GAGA","text":"GAGA"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定理</span></strong> (Grothendieck) $\\mathbb P^1$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的全纯向量丛都可写成</span>\n$$\r\n\\mathcal O(d_1)^{n_1}\\oplus \\cdots \\oplus \\mathcal O(d_k)^{n_k}.\r\n$$</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定理</span></strong>. "},{"Local":{"url":"/椭圆曲线","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">椭圆曲线</span>"}},{"Plain":" $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Picard群","text":"Picard <span lang=\"zh\">群</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">同构于</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">本身</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">复流形的切丛是全纯向量丛</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">另见</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Hermite向量丛","text":"Hermite <span lang=\"zh\">向量丛</span>"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"/线丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">线丛</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}